{%- comment -%}
  Prints the key of the product metafield that holds the gallery images for the page's language:
  gallery_nl in Dutch and gallery_fr in French (namespace custom, type list.file_reference).
  Prints nothing in any other language and on every page that is not a product page; the native
  product media apply there. The feed template reads the same two metafields.

  The caller decides on the images, so an empty or missing metafield also keeps the native media:
    capture kc_gallery_key
      render 'kc-localized-gallery-key'
    endcapture
    if kc_gallery_key != blank
      assign kc_gallery_images = product.metafields.custom[kc_gallery_key].value | where: 'media_type', 'image'
    endif

  Admin steps and evidence: docs/pdp/localized-gallery/
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if request.page_type == 'product'
    assign kc_gallery_language = request.locale.iso_code | slice: 0, 2
    if kc_gallery_language == 'nl' or kc_gallery_language == 'fr'
      echo 'gallery_' | append: kc_gallery_language
    endif
  endif
-%}
